<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Cadbury Q3 profits up.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Cadbury Q3 profits up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter result for Cadbury Nigeria Plc to end-September. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				  1996	1995</p>
<p> Turnover		     4,800  vs 3,400</p>
<p> Profit before taxation    460.3 vs 371.1</p>
<p> Taxation			147.3 vs 137.3</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	 313 vs 233.8</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
